= Quarterly Summaries

The Q1 summary aggregates data from January, February, and March.
Trends are compared against the same quarter of the prior year.

The Q2 summary aggregates data from April, May, and June.
Trends are compared against the same quarter of the prior year.

The Q3 summary aggregates data from July, August, and September.
Trends are compared against the same quarter of the prior year.

The Q4 summary aggregates data from October, November, and December.
Trends are compared against the same quarter of the prior year.

= Annual Overview

The annual overview synthesizes all twelve monthly reports into a single narrative.
Key findings are highlighted, and recommendations for the following year are listed.

The executive summary is a condensed version of the annual overview,
intended for distribution to board members and external stakeholders.
